<%= render PlatformCore::Ui::PageHeaderComponent.new(
      title: "A small social network for Austin",
      subtitle: "Invite-only, community-built, and intentionally fewer than 200 people."
    ) %>

<div class="space-y-6">
  <%= render PlatformCore::Ui::CardComponent.new do %>
    <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4 text-base leading-7 text-ink-muted">
      <p class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink">Hi, I’m Dane Jensen.</p>
      <p>
        I’m starting CitySocial as an artisanal social network: a small place where we can
        build the features we actually want, together. The goal is to help us stay more
        engaged with one another and with Austin—not to keep us scrolling.
      </p>
      <p>
        Keeping the community under 200 people means it can stay personal, useful, and
        shaped by the people in it.
      </p>
    </div>
  <% end %>

  <div>
    <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl text-ink">What CitySocial should make easier</h2>
    <div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
      <%= render PlatformCore::Ui::CardComponent.new do %>
        <%= render PlatformCore::Ui::BadgeComponent.new(variant: :brand) do %>Know Austin<% end %>
        <h3 class="mt-3 text-lg text-ink">Local news that matters</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-6 text-ink-muted">
          A shared view of Austin news, neighborhood updates, openings, events, and the
          stories worth talking about with people who live here.
        </p>
      <% end %>

      <%= render PlatformCore::Ui::CardComponent.new do %>
        <%= render PlatformCore::Ui::BadgeComponent.new(variant: :agave) do %>Meet up<% end %>
        <h3 class="mt-3 text-lg text-ink">Turn “maybe” into tonight</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-6 text-ink-muted">
          Make it easy to start a movie night or post “I’m at this café—come meet me.”
          Nearby friends can quickly say they’re in and turn an ordinary evening into time together.
        </p>
      <% end %>

      <%= render PlatformCore::Ui::CardComponent.new do %>
        <%= render PlatformCore::Ui::BadgeComponent.new(variant: :neutral) do %>Share more<% end %>
        <h3 class="mt-3 text-lg text-ink">A community tool shelf</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-6 text-ink-muted">
          Show the tools you’re happy to lend—from a drill to a ladder—so neighbors can
          borrow what already exists instead of buying it again.
        </p>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%= render PlatformCore::Ui::CardComponent.new do |card| %>
    <% card.with_header do %>
      <h2 class="text-xl text-ink">How borrowing a tool could work</h2>
    <% end %>

    <ol class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-4">
      <li>
        <p class="font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-brand-700">01 · LIST</p>
        <p class="mt-1 font-semibold text-ink">Share what you have</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-muted">Add a photo, a few details, and when the tool is usually available.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p class="font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-brand-700">02 · REQUEST</p>
        <p class="mt-1 font-semibold text-ink">Ask to borrow it</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-muted">Choose dates and tell the owner what you’re working on.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p class="font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-brand-700">03 · HAND OFF</p>
        <p class="mt-1 font-semibold text-ink">Make a plan</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-muted">The owner approves the request and both people coordinate pickup.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p class="font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-brand-700">04 · RETURN</p>
        <p class="mt-1 font-semibold text-ink">Bring it back</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-muted">A friendly reminder closes the loop, followed by a thank-you.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  <% end %>
</div>
